            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Prince should be somewhere around the Marketplace. Remember, he's got black fur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "48705",
      "subQuestName": "Find the cat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4870501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4870501": {
            "id": "4870501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, Prince has very keen senses. It didn't take much to scare him off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4870502"
            ]
          },
          "4870502": {
            "id": "4870502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "See if you can approach him crouching <color=#00E1FFFF>from behind</color>. That way, your footsteps will be quieter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4870503"
            ]
          },
          "4870503": {
            "id": "4870503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It must be difficult not being able to float, hee-hee.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4870504"
            ]
          },
          "4870504": {
            "id": "4870504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you're anxious to find Prince, why not coax him to you with some <color=#00E1FFFF>Fish</color>? Kitty cats do love eating fish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4870505"
            ]
          },
          "4870505": {
            "id": "4870505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you've run out of <color=#00E1FFFF>Fish</color>, go grab some more from the lake. Now, back to it!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
